Scenario: Generate new detached DXP and Commerce Production non aggregate and combined aggregate licenses
	Testing the ability to generate non aggregate detached licenses for two separate DXP and Commerce products as well as a combined aggregate for both products for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki on provisioning

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
