Scenario: Delete Commerce license from new DXP Production and Virtual Cluster non aggregate licenses and Commerce Production and Virtual Cluster non aggregate licenses and combined aggregate licenses
	Testing the ability to generate non aggregate licenses for two separate DXP and Commerce products before removing one Commerce license for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki on provisioning

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORLICKORLIC                         | |
	| Contact Email Address | lic.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
