Scenario: Download DXP and Commerce Production non aggregate and combined aggregate licenses
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	Testing the ability to download a generated non aggregated licenses for two separate DXP and Commerce products as well as a combined aggregate for both products for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki on provisioning

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
